		"Starting. Keep this page open until it says the restore is finished." => "正在启动。请保持此页面打开，直到显示恢复已完成。",
		"State" => "状态",
		"Status" => "状态",
		"Switch" => "切换",
		"Switch on AI agents" => "开启 AI 代理",
		"Switch to the imported site" => "切换到导入的站点",
		"Switch to the imported site?" => "切换到导入的站点？",
		"Switched off, every connection stops at once and no new one can start." => "关闭后，所有连接会立即停止，且无法开始新的连接。",
		"Switched to the imported site. Plugins are now turned back on one by one." => "已切换到导入的站点。插件正在逐个重新启用。",
		"Switching replaces this site's database tables and wp-content folders with the imported ones in a few seconds. The previous ones are kept, so \"Roll back the import\" puts them back. Your account and this plugin's connections are kept. Plugins are then turned back on one by one." => "切换会在几秒钟内用导入的数据表和 wp-content 文件夹替换此站点的数据库表和 wp-content 文件夹。原有的会被保留，因此“回滚导入”可以将其恢复。您的账户和此插件的连接会被保留。随后插件会逐个重新启用。",
		"Tables move from the prefix %1\$s to %2\$s." => "数据表前缀将从 %1\$s 改为 %2\$s。",
		"Takes up to 20 seconds." => "最多需要 20 秒。",
		"Test connections" => "测试连接",
		"The 5 latest tool calls by AI apps" => "AI 应用最近的 5 次工具调用",
		"The AI app gets at most the rights of your WordPress account (%s), within the level you choose when you approve it." => "AI 应用最多获得您的 WordPress 账户（%s）的权限，并以您批准时选择的级别为限。",
		"The AI app gets the rights of the WordPress account that approves it, within the level chosen on the consent screen and set in Access." => "AI 应用将获得批准它的 WordPress 账户的权限，但以授权页面上选择的级别和“访问权限”中的设置为限。",
		"The Authorization block and its backup copy were removed from .htaccess." => "已从 .htaccess 中移除 Authorization 块及其备份副本。",
		"The Authorization header does not reach WordPress." => "Authorization 标头无法到达 WordPress。",
		"The Authorization header reaches WordPress." => "Authorization 标头能到达 WordPress。",
		"The MCP endpoint asks for sign-in." => "MCP 端点要求登录。",
		"The MCP endpoint does not ask for sign-in." => "MCP 端点未要求登录。",
		"The WordPress folder is read-only on this host, as on managed platforms such as Cloudron, so the restorer cannot be installed. Use the host's own restore for now; this backup can still move the site elsewhere later." => "此主机上的 WordPress 文件夹为只读（与 Cloudron 等托管平台相同），因此无法安装恢复程序。目前请使用主机自带的恢复功能；此备份以后仍可用于将站点迁移到其他地方。",
		"The access is sent to this address. Check that it belongs to the app you are connecting." => "访问权限将发送到此地址。请确认它属于您正在连接的应用。",
		"The app loses access to this site at once. To use it again, connect it again from the app." => "该应用将立即失去对此站点的访问权限。如需再次使用，请从应用中重新连接。",
		"The app was not registered: a name and at least one return address are required." => "应用未注册：需要名称和至少一个返回地址。",
		"The backup action did not complete." => "备份操作未完成。",
		"The backup failed. The reason is shown in the list below. Try again." => "备份失败。原因显示在下方列表中。请重试。",
		"The backup reads back correctly." => "备份可以正确读取。",
		"The change did not help, so .htaccess was put back as it was. Ask your host to pass the Authorization header to PHP, with the lines below." => "此更改没有效果，因此 .htaccess 已恢复原样。请把下面的配置行交给您的主机商，请其将 Authorization 标头传递给 PHP。",
		"The collation %1\$s does not exist on this database server. Tables are converted to %2\$s." => "此数据库服务器上不存在排序规则 %1\$s。数据表将转换为 %2\$s。",
		"The compatibility report has blockers. Fix them, then check the source again." => "兼容性报告中有阻止项。请修复后再次检查源站点。",
		"The copy of the previous site is deleted. Rolling back will no longer be possible." => "之前站点的副本将被删除。之后将无法再回滚。",
		"The database and the files of this site are replaced with this backup. The site shows a maintenance page meanwhile." => "此站点的数据库和文件将被此备份替换。在此期间站点会显示维护页面。",
		"The discovery address answers." => "发现地址有响应。",
		"The discovery address does not answer." => "发现地址无响应。",
		"The downloaded update does not match its published SHA-256, so it was not installed." => "下载的更新与其公布的 SHA-256 不匹配，因此未安装。",
		"The export link must start with https://: the whole site travels through it." => "导出链接必须以 https:// 开头：整个站点都会通过它传输。",
		"The export link was not created." => "导出链接未创建。",
		"The import action did not complete." => "导入操作未完成。",
		"The import cannot start until the blockers are fixed. Fix them, then check again." => "在修复阻止项之前，导入无法开始。请修复后再次检查。",
		"The import did not start." => "导入未开始。",
		"The import downloads the source, then prepares its files and database beside this site. This site is replaced only when you choose to switch, and the switch can be rolled back." => "导入会下载源站点，然后在此站点旁边准备其文件和数据库。只有在您选择切换时，此站点才会被替换，且切换可以回滚。",
		"The import folder could not be created next to the backups." => "无法在备份旁边创建导入文件夹。",
		"The import stopped. The reason is shown below." => "导入已停止。原因显示在下方。",
		"The import stopped:" => "导入已停止：",
		"The imported site is in place. Roll it back or keep it first." => "导入的站点正在使用中。请先回滚或保留它。",
		"The imported site is prepared beside this one. Nothing has changed here yet." => "导入的站点已在此站点旁边准备就绪。此处目前尚未有任何变化。",
		"The imported site is ready. Nothing has changed on this site yet." => "导入的站点已就绪。此站点目前尚未有任何变化。",
		"The imported tables and files are removed from this server. This site is not affected." => "导入的数据表和文件将从此服务器中移除。此站点不受影响。",
		"The key works. Chrome has too few real visits to this site yet." => "密钥有效。但 Chrome 记录到的此站点真实访问量还太少。",
		"The last backup did not finish." => "上次备份未完成。",
		"The link points to this site itself." => "该链接指向的就是此站点本身。",
		"The report and the files set aside are deleted. The imported site stays." => "报告和已搁置的文件将被删除。导入的站点会保留。",
		"The restore stopped: %s The site may be partly restored. Restore your most recent backup of the previous state." => "恢复已中止：%s 站点可能只恢复了一部分。请恢复您最近一次针对之前状态的备份。",
		"The restorer could not be written to the WordPress folder." => "无法将恢复程序写入 WordPress 文件夹。",
		"The return address does not match this application." => "返回地址与此应用程序不匹配。",
		"The rollback did not complete." => "回滚未完成。",
		"The server configuration is fixed: the Authorization header now reaches WordPress. A copy of the previous .htaccess was kept next to it." => "服务器配置已修复：Authorization 标头现在能到达 WordPress。之前的 .htaccess 副本已保存在其旁边。",
		"The site does not use HTTPS." => "站点未使用 HTTPS。",
		"The site settings limit what your account can give an app." => "站点设置限制了您的账户可以授予应用的权限。",
		"The site that has it can no longer download this backup. An import already downloaded goes on." => "持有该链接的站点将无法再下载此备份。已完成下载的导入会继续进行。",
		"The site uses HTTPS." => "站点使用 HTTPS。",
		"The source answered. Read the compatibility report below before importing." => "源站点已响应。导入前请阅读下方的兼容性报告。",
		"The source could not be checked." => "无法检查源站点。",
		"The source did not answer as Site Agent MCP does (HTTP %d). Check that the plugin is active and up to date there." => "源站点的响应不符合 Site Agent MCP 的格式（HTTP %d）。请确认该插件在源站点上已启用且为最新版本。",
		"The source is downloaded and prepared next to this site. Nothing changes here until you switch." => "源站点将被下载并在此站点旁边准备就绪。在您切换之前，此处不会有任何变化。",
		"The source keeps its media outside wp-content (UPLOADS constant). Those files are not imported." => "源站点将媒体文件存放在 wp-content 之外（UPLOADS 常量）。这些文件不会被导入。",
		"The source refused this link: it expired, was revoked, or was not copied whole." => "源站点拒绝了此链接：它已过期、已被撤销，或未完整复制。",
		"The source runs PHP %1\$s and this server PHP %2\$s. Plugins written for a newer PHP may stop working; each plugin is tested after the switch." => "源站点运行 PHP %1\$s，此服务器运行 PHP %2\$s。为较新 PHP 编写的插件可能无法运行；切换后会逐个测试每个插件。",
		"The source runs WordPress %1\$s and this site %2\$s. Update WordPress here first: a database cannot move to an older WordPress." => "源站点运行 WordPress %1\$s，此站点运行 %2\$s。请先在此处更新 WordPress：数据库无法迁移到较旧版本的 WordPress。",
		"The source runs on %1\$s and this site on %2\$s. Rules written in .htaccess files are not imported; recreate their redirects here." => "源站点运行于 %1\$s，此站点运行于 %2\$s。.htaccess 文件中的规则不会被导入；请在此处重新创建其中的重定向。",
		"The source's copy of Site Agent MCP was not imported; this site keeps its own." => "未导入源站点的 Site Agent MCP；此站点保留自己的版本。",
		"The switch did not happen. This site is as it was." => "切换未执行。此站点保持原样。",
		"The table name %s would be longer than the 64 characters the database allows." => "数据表名 %s 将超过数据库允许的 64 个字符。",
		"The web server is blocking /.well-known. Let it pass to WordPress. A security plugin or an Nginx rule on dot paths is the usual cause." => "Web 服务器拦截了 /.well-known。请让它交给 WordPress 处理。常见原因是安全插件或针对点开头路径的 Nginx 规则。",
		"There is no stopped import to resume." => "没有可继续的已停止导入。",
		"These administrator accounts of the source come with the import and can sign in here with their passwords: %s. Their application passwords and open sessions are removed at the switch. Remove the accounts you do not know afterwards." => "源站点的以下管理员账户会随导入一起迁移，并可使用其密码在此登录：%s。切换时会移除它们的应用程序密码和已打开的会话。之后请删除您不认识的账户。",
		"These drop-ins are set aside, not installed: %s. Their plugins recreate them when you turn their feature on again." => "以下 drop-in 将被搁置，不会安装：%s。当您重新开启相应功能时，其插件会重新创建它们。",
		"These plugins only work at the source's host or web server and are deactivated: %s." => "以下插件只能在源站点的主机商或 Web 服务器上工作，将被停用：%s。",
		"This application could not be identified." => "无法识别此应用程序。",
		"This backup comes from another folder or table prefix. Moving a site to another server comes in a later version." => "此备份来自其他文件夹或数据表前缀。将站点迁移到其他服务器的功能将在后续版本中提供。",
		"This backup does not read back correctly: %s" => "此备份无法正确读取：%s",
		"This connection attempt has expired. Start again from Site Agent > Services." => "此连接尝试已过期。请从“Site Agent > 服务”重新开始。",
		"This connection returns to an app running on your own computer. Continue only if you just started it yourself." => "此连接将返回到在您自己电脑上运行的应用。仅当您刚刚亲自启动它时才继续。",
		"This database server does not support the character set %s used by the source." => "此数据库服务器不支持源站点使用的字符集 %s。",
		"This export uses an unknown backup format (%s). Update Site Agent MCP on both sites." => "此导出使用了未知的备份格式（%s）。请在两个站点上都更新 Site Agent MCP。",
		"This is Site Agent MCP Lite, the edition published on wordpress.org. Site Agent MCP Full, distributed from its own site, also offers:" => "这是 Site Agent MCP Lite，即发布在 wordpress.org 上的版本。Site Agent MCP Full 从其自有网站分发，另外提供：",
		"This is not an export link. On the source site, create a backup, choose Export for migration, and copy the whole link, including the part after #." => "这不是导出链接。请在源站点上创建备份，选择“导出用于迁移”，并复制完整链接，包括 # 之后的部分。",
		"This page has expired. Start the connection again from your AI application." => "此页面已过期。请从您的 AI 应用程序重新发起连接。",
		"This replaces the database and the files of this site with the backup. wp-config.php is kept. Files added since the backup stay in place. Every AI connection ends: reconnect your AI apps afterwards. The site shows a maintenance page meanwhile." => "这会用备份替换此站点的数据库和文件。wp-config.php 会被保留。备份之后新增的文件保持不变。所有 AI 连接都会结束：之后请重新连接您的 AI 应用。在此期间站点会显示维护页面。",
		"This restore has expired. Start it again from Site Agent > Backups." => "此恢复已过期。请从“Site Agent > 备份”重新开始。",
		"This restore was started from another browser session." => "此恢复是从另一个浏览器会话中启动的。",
		"This return address is not allowed on this site: %s. An administrator can add it in Site Agent > Settings." => "此站点不允许该返回地址：%s。管理员可以在“Site Agent > 设置”中添加。",
		"This server runs IIS: ask your host to pass the Authorization header to PHP." => "此服务器运行的是 IIS：请让您的主机商将 Authorization 标头传递给 PHP。",
		"This server runs a newer PHP (%2\$s) than the source (%1\$s). Each plugin is tested after the switch." => "此服务器的 PHP（%2\$s）比源站点（%1\$s）更新。切换后会逐个测试每个插件。",
		"This site goes back to how it was before the switch. Changes made on the imported site since are set aside with it." => "此站点将恢复到切换前的状态。此后在导入的站点上所做的更改会随其一起被搁置保存。",
		"This site is as it was before the switch. The imported data is kept so you can look at it or delete it." => "此站点已恢复到切换前的状态。导入的数据仍保留，您可以查看或删除。",
		"This site is replaced by the imported one. The previous site is kept until you choose to keep the import, and you can roll back." => "此站点将被导入的站点替换。在您选择保留导入之前，之前的站点会一直保留，您可以回滚。",
		"This site runs a newer WordPress (%2\$s) than the source (%1\$s). The database is upgraded after the switch." => "此站点的 WordPress（%2\$s）比源站点（%1\$s）更新。切换后会升级数据库。",
		"This site's must-use plugin %s was kept; the source's copy was not used." => "已保留此站点的必用插件 %s；未使用源站点的副本。",
		"This update could not be checked against its signed manifest, so it was not installed. Try again later." => "无法根据其签名清单校验此更新，因此未安装。请稍后再试。",
		"Tick the box and type IMPORT to confirm." => "请勾选复选框并输入 IMPORT 以确认。",
		"Tick the box and type RESTORE to confirm." => "请勾选复选框并输入 RESTORE 以确认。",
		"To connect an app, open new connections here, then start from the app within 15 minutes. A link received by email or chat can never connect an app on its own." => "要连接应用，请先在此处开放新连接，然后在 15 分钟内从应用发起。通过电子邮件或聊天收到的链接本身永远无法连接应用。",
		"To do" => "待完成",
		"Tool" => "工具",
		"Tool calls by AI apps, newest first" => "AI 应用的工具调用，最新的在前",
		"Tool calls by AI apps, newest first." => "AI 应用的工具调用，最新的在前。",
		"Try again" => "重试",
		"Trying again." => "正在重试。",
		"Turned off in wp-config.php by SAMCP_DISABLE_POWER_TOOLS, so it cannot be changed here." => "已在 wp-config.php 中通过 SAMCP_DISABLE_POWER_TOOLS 关闭，因此无法在此更改。",
		"Turning plugins back on one by one" => "正在逐个重新启用插件",
		"Type IMPORT to confirm:" => "输入 IMPORT 以确认：",
		"Type RESTORE to confirm:" => "输入 RESTORE 以确认：",
		"Under API restrictions, choose Restrict key and select those two APIs. A stolen key then cannot be used for anything else." => "在 API restrictions（API 限制）下，选择 Restrict key（限制密钥）并选中这两个 API。这样即使密钥被盗也无法用于其他用途。",
		"Under Credentials, choose Create credentials, then API key." => "在 Credentials（凭据）下，选择 Create credentials（创建凭据），然后选择 API key（API 密钥）。",
		"Unknown file." => "未知文件。",
		"Up to date" => "已是最新",
		"Update addresses registered at outside services: webhooks, payment gateways, OAuth apps, scheduled tasks of the old host's control panel." => "更新在外部服务中登记的地址：webhook、支付网关、OAuth 应用，以及旧主机商控制面板中的计划任务。",
		"Used" => "使用次数",
		"Valid until %s" => "有效期至 %s",
		"Verify" => "验证",
		"View all activity" => "查看全部活动",
		"WP Mail SMTP: send a test email, and enter the SMTP password again if sending fails." => "WP Mail SMTP：发送一封测试邮件，如果发送失败，请重新输入 SMTP 密码。",
		"Warnings" => "警告",
		"What happens" => "将会发生什么",
		"What only you can do" => "需要您亲自完成的事项",
		"What the app can do" => "该应用可以做什么",
		"What the import did" => "导入执行的操作",
		"What was downloaded and prepared is deleted. This site is not affected." => "已下载和准备的内容将被删除。此站点不受影响。",
		"With \"Everything the account can do\", the app can also install plugins from wordpress.org, which gives it wide control of the site." => "选择“账户能做的一切”时，应用还可以从 wordpress.org 安装插件，这会让它对站点拥有广泛的控制权。",
		"WooCommerce is active on the source. Orders placed there after the backup are not in this import." => "源站点上启用了 WooCommerce。备份之后在源站点产生的订单不包含在本次导入中。",
		"WooCommerce sessions cleared." => "已清除 WooCommerce 会话。",
		"WooCommerce: register the payment gateways' webhooks for this address and check WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced > Webhooks. Subscriptions stay in staging mode until you confirm this is the live site." => "WooCommerce：为此地址注册支付网关的 webhook，并检查“WooCommerce > 设置 > 高级 > Webhooks”。在您确认这是正式站点之前，订阅将保持在预发布（staging）模式。",
		"WordPress and PHP" => "WordPress 和 PHP",
		"WordPress cannot write .htaccess on this server. Add the lines below yourself, or ask your host." => "WordPress 无法在此服务器上写入 .htaccess。请自行添加下面的配置行，或联系您的主机商。",
		"Wordfence: run its firewall optimization again on this server; its firewall data was not imported." => "Wordfence：请在此服务器上重新运行防火墙优化；其防火墙数据未被导入。",
		"Writes and edits posts, pages, media, categories, tags and comments, and their SEO fields. No settings, plugins, themes or accounts." => "撰写和编辑文章、页面、媒体、分类、标签和评论，以及它们的 SEO 字段。不涉及设置、插件、主题或账户。",
		"Yoast SEO indexables cleared: they hold old addresses, and Yoast rebuilds them." => "已清除 Yoast SEO 的 indexables：其中包含旧地址，Yoast 会重新构建它们。",
		"Yoast SEO: run the SEO data optimization in Yoast SEO > Tools." => "Yoast SEO：在“Yoast SEO > 工具”中运行 SEO 数据优化。",
		"You are not allowed to do this." => "您无权执行此操作。",
		"You can disconnect this app at any time in your WordPress admin, under Site Agent for administrators or Profile > AI connections for other accounts." => "您可以随时在 WordPress 后台断开此应用：管理员在 Site Agent 中操作，其他账户在“个人资料 > AI 连接”中操作。",
		"You may have to sign in again." => "您可能需要重新登录。",
		"Your AI app runs it with its security_audit tool, which changes nothing." => "由您的 AI 应用通过 security_audit 工具运行，该工具不做任何更改。",
		"Your account %s replaced the source account with the same login: your password and session are kept." => "您的账户 %s 已替换源站点中登录名相同的账户：您的密码和会话保持不变。",
		"Your account %s was added to the imported users." => "您的账户 %s 已添加到导入的用户中。",
